  "contentHtml": "<p>미지의 세계를 마주하고, 새로운 규칙을 발견할 때&#8212;<b>귀납</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p>이미 쌓은 지식을 바탕으로, 미래를 예측하거나 구체적 상황을 검증할 때&#8212;<b>연역</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p>연역적 탐구는</p><p>반드시 ‘기존의 지식’이 있을 때에만 시작할 수 있습니다.</p><p>그 지식이 탄탄할수록, 우리의 예측과 실험은 더욱 명확한 방향을 갖습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>대조군 : 양파 칭찬 실험에서 칭찬의 횟수를 점점 증가시켜서 할 경우, 대조군은 무엇인가?</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28f183a56f31a41cd9c40d6473246d2f99ca7e45\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28f183a56f31a41cd9c40d6473246d2f99ca7e45\" data-origin-width=\"684\" data-origin-height=\"105\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c20599551799effa598b6dc3ba3f9b1178eb5432\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c20599551799effa598b6dc3ba3f9b1178eb5432\" data-origin-width=\"503\" data-origin-height=\"74\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/67ed5245fac2052055ee4788221abcbad43e7a4d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/67ed5245fac2052055ee4788221abcbad43e7a4d\" data-origin-width=\"699\" data-origin-height=\"424\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a5a13ecf38cb789fde4ae1ab91c3ebb7e66a36d6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a5a13ecf38cb789fde4ae1ab91c3ebb7e66a36d6\" data-origin-width=\"700\" data-origin-heigh